    "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:00Z",
    "precision": "day",
    "label": "Wikipedia, \"VisionQuest\", filming (revision of 2026-11-06 10:00 UTC)",
    "quote": "Principal photography began by March 14, 2025, at Pinewood Studios in London, under the working title Tin Man, with Byrne, Monteiro, Natali, and Matalas directing. Christopher Ross, Neville Kidd, and Ben Smithard were the cinematographers. Location shooting took place in and around London, as well as at various sites across the United Kingdom.",
    "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=VisionQuest&oldid=1384061425"
  },
  {
    "id": "wiki:film:1384061425:1",
    "kind": "report",
    "source": "wikipedia-article",
    "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:00Z",
    "precision": "day",
    "label": "Wikipedia, \"VisionQuest\", filming (revision of 2026-11-06 10:00 UTC)",
    "quote": "From late March to early April, filming took place at a local pub in the Chiltern Hills, England, which served as the location for The Old Selkie pub.",
    "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=VisionQuest&oldid=1384061425"
  },
  {
    "id": "wiki:film:1384061425:2",
    "kind": "report",
    "source": "wikipedia-article",
    "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:00Z",
    "precision": "day",
    "label": "Wikipedia, \"VisionQuest\", filming (revision of 2026-11-06 10:00 UTC)",
    "quote": "The set dressing included the Saltire, the national flag of Scotland, displayed outside the building.",
    "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=VisionQuest&oldid=1384061425"
  },
  {
    "id": "wiki:film:1384061425:3",
    "kind": "report",
    "source": "wikipedia-article",
    "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:00Z",
    "precision": "day",
    "label": "Wikipedia, \"VisionQuest\", filming (revision of 2026-11-06 10:00 UTC)",
    "quote": "Other locations included Hatfield House in Hertfordshire, England, which stood in for Horton Manor; and White Waltham Airfield in Berkshire, England, used for scenes set in Paladin's jet hangar.",
    "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=VisionQuest&oldid=1384061425"
  },
